          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\nNow let me create a test case and fix the issue. The problem is clear:\n\n1. In `TransformFilterProcessor.generateArguments()` - it already has a check to prevent duplicates (`if (!argNames.contains(columnName))`)\n2. In `ProjectionColumnProcessor.generateTransformExpressionKey()` - it does NOT have such a check, so duplicate column references cause duplicate parameters\n\nLet me fix the `ProjectionColumnProcessor` to handle duplicate column references:\n\n",
