        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\nNow I need to also update the `generateParams` method to handle the case where a column is referenced multiple times in the expression. The current implementation iterates through `originalColumnNames` which may have duplicates, but we need to match them with the unique parameters:\n\n",
